{"parentUuid":"d8370245-a7ac-40c5-b8f0-572c54267297","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're building Addo Labs' ALS drug-discovery demo, and I just suggested a clearer patient-profile page: an outcome-focused title and a dropzone showing what the PDF is read for. Next, pick the wording and confirm it's safe to edit files someone else has uncommitted changes in.","timestamp":"2026-11-08T05:46:32.625Z","uuid":"ce749c76-dfc0-4b95-8a0f-0be6c06274af","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
