\" /> Estimated from at-home sessions</span>","-            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><i className=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground\" /> Clinician-rated</span>","-            <span className=\"ml-auto\">Model output · not a diagnosis</span>","+            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><i className=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-chart-3\" /> Clinic ALSFRS-R</span>","+            <span>Dashed: straight-line extrapolation at the clinic’s −0.6/month, not a forecast</span>","           </CardFooter>","         </Card>"," ","         <Card className=\"col-span-12 [--card-spacing:--spacing(5)] md:col-span-6 xl:col-span-4\">","           <CardHeader>","-            <CardTitle className=\"text-lg font-normal\">Early-detection signal</CardTitle>","-            <CardAction className=\"text-[0.625rem] text-muted-foreground\">vs your baseline</CardAction>","+            <CardTitle className=\"text-lg font-normal\">ALSFRS-R by domain</CardTitle>","+            <CardAction className=\"text-[0.625rem] text-muted-foreground\">Sep 2026 · each of 12</CardAction>","           </CardHeader>","+          <CardContent className=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">","+            {ALSFRS_DOMAINS.map((d) => (","+              <div key={d.domain} className=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">","+                <div className=\"flex justify-between\"><span>{d.domain}</span><span>{d.score} / 12</span></div>","+                <Meter value={d.score} max={12} tone={d.score <= 7 ? 'bg-flag' : 'bg-chart-3'} />","+              </div>","+            ))}","+          </CardContent>","+          <CardFooter className=\"border-t text-[0.6875rem] text-muted-foreground\">Fine and gross motor are most affected; breathing best preserved.</CardFooter>","+        </Card>","+","+        <Card className=\"col-span-12 [--card-spacing:--spacing(5)] md:col-span-6 xl:col-span-4\">","+          <CardHeader>","+            <CardTitle className=\"text-lg font-normal\">Strong in the morning</CardTitle>","+            <CardAction className=\"text-[0.625rem] text-muted-foreground\">same passage, 9 am vs 4 pm</CardAction>","+          </CardHeader>","           <CardContent className=\"flex flex-col gap-5\">","-            {modalities.map((m) => {","-              const Icon = ICONS[m.key]","-              // meter: −4σ … +1σ, filled from 0 toward the value","-              const pct = (v: number) => ((Math.max(-4, Math.min(1, v)) + 4) / 5) * 100","-              return (","-                <div key={m.key} className=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">","-                  <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">","-                    <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\">","-                      <Icon className=\"size-4 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden />","-                      {m.label}","-                      <span className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">{m.domain}</span>","-                    </span>","-                    <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\">","-                      <strong className=\"font-normal\">{signed(m.z)}σ</strong>","-                      <StatusBadge status={m.status} />","-                    </span>","+            {([","+              ['Speaking rate', SPEECH.rate.am, SPEECH.rate.pm, 200, SPEECH.rate.typical[0], 'words/min'],","+              ['Intelligibility', SPEECH.intelligibility.am, SPEECH.intelligibility.pm, 100, SPEECH.intelligibility.typical, '%'],","+            ] as const).map(([label, am, pm, max, ref, unit]) => (","+              <div key={label} className=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">","+                <p className=\"text-muted-foreground\">{label} <span className=\"text-xs\">({unit})</span></p>","+                {([['9 am', am, 'bg-chart-3'], ['4 pm', pm, 'bg-watch']] as const).map(([t, v, tone]) => (","+                  <div key={t} className=\"grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr_2.5rem] items-center gap-2\">","+                    <span className=\"text-xs text-mu