{"parentUuid":"81d76216-dd8c-4ead-b059-08dca4512785","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01VxCfRieZ7XgZDXYJreitPx","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"71982a6f-b4b3-4a2a-a4f5-99de9caa5978","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:08:59.848Z","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
{"parentUuid":"71982a6f-b4b3-4a2a-a4f5-99de9caa5978","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpxkFrqe2gHFqacDzF5P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Patient monitoring now shows Alex Chen from the case file, and the \"Sample data\" tag is gone. The build passes, and I checked the page in screenshots.\n\n**This is a different dashboard, not the same charts refilled.** The old version plotted 180 days of at-home typing, speech and handwriting sessions. The file has nothing like that: it's clinic visits and one-off tests. So I built the page around what it does have:\n- **Headline numbers:** ALSFRS-R 32/48 (−0.6 points per month), vital capacity 76% sitting, weight 77.5 kg (down 8.5), and neurofilament light 88 (the reference is below 15).\n- **ALSFRS-R trajectory:** the six measured scores from 0 to 27 months, with the carpal tunnel surgery and the diagnosis marked. A dashed straight line continues the clinic's −0.6 a month for a year, labelled \"not a forecast\".\n- **ALSFRS-R by domain:** bulbar 9, fine motor 6, gross motor 7, breathing 10, each out of 12.\n- **\"Strong in the morning\":** speaking rate 165 vs 118 words a minute and intelligibility 98% vs 91%, at 9 am vs 4 pm.\n- **Breathing:** vital capacity sitting vs lying flat for June and September, against the 80% threshold.\n- **Hand function:** right vs left grip, pinch and peg test, against typical values.\n- **Weight:** the three weigh-ins.\n- **Flags:** the five concerns the file itself raises: breathing lying flat, falls, afternoon speech, coughing on liquids, weight loss.\n- **Strength grades:** how each muscle's score has changed between visits.\n- **Timeline:** the 25 months from first symptom to diagnosis.\n- **Tests:** a collapsible table of eight results with reference ranges and their source.\n\n**Every number is copied from the file, with nothing filled in between visits.** The values live in `src/lib/alex-case.ts`, with page references. I removed the old generated data (`sample-data.ts`).\n\n**Things to know:**\n- **No PDF upload here.** The page reads Alex's values directly from that file; it doesn't parse the PDF the way the pipeline's case upload does. Any other patient would need their own data file.\n- **Other uncommitted work in the tree:** `pages.tsx`, `case-patient.ts`, `report-pdf.ts` and a few more. I didn't touch any of them.\n- **Not committed.** I haven't committed either change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":851071,"output_tokens":843,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":843,"cache_read_input_tokens":851071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1aa5b67b-5418-4207-b377-f1629ca08170","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgpxkFain3KpUoVW2Ax3p","requestRef":"4c50000c-6c18-4f1b-9f1d-b93813979f59","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"1d0f85d6-4ccd-47c0-b2a1-310e624d614b","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:08:59.847Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
