{"parentUuid":"c2899e4c-69ee-4b02-9a14-74cce54c09e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpzSQM3g7oGiLAQXckYQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've renumbered the steps 01–05 and rewritten all five headers. The sidebar and each page's label now count 01 to 05.\n\n| # | Title | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01 · Patient case | **Start with the patient** | Upload the case file as a PDF. Every later step is grounded in what it contains. |\n| 02 · Patient analysis | **Clinical picture** | The analysis agent summarises the key findings and checks the genetics against NCBI and ClinVar. |\n| 03 · Profile agents | **Five therapeutic hypotheses** | Five agents run in parallel, each defining the drug that would test one disease mechanism in this patient. |\n| 04 · DRKG embedding | **Matching profiles to known drugs** | Each profile is placed in the DRKG knowledge graph and matched to its nearest compounds by cosine similarity. |\n| 05 · Research report | **Ranked for this patient** | A research agent weighs evidence, drug interactions, cost, access and treatment burden, then writes a cited report. |\n\nWhat I aimed for:\n- **Title:** a short phrase saying what the page is for, without a trailing full stop.\n- **Description:** one sentence on how the step works.\n- **Labels:** step 1's label now says \"Patient case\", matching the sidebar, instead of \"Patient profile\".\n\n**Alternatives if any don't land:**\n- **01:** \"Patient case file\" · \"Load the case\"\n- **02:** \"What the case shows\" · \"Key findings\"\n- **03:** \"Defining the ideal drug\" · \"One mechanism per agent\"\n- **04:** \"Nearest known compounds\" · \"From profile to candidates\"\n- **05:** \"Evidence-weighted ranking\" · \"Candidates, ranked and cited\"\n\n**The type-check now fails, but not because of this change.** Someone is editing `src/pages/Home.tsx` right now, adding a Focused ultrasound page, and it still imports `SAMPLE_PATIENT` (line 15) without using it. The app still runs and Vite still builds; only the type-check, and so `npm run build`, fails. I left their file alone. The fix is deleting `SAMPLE_PATIENT, ` from that import, which whoever is editing it can do."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":467,"cache_read_input_tokens":877730,"output_tokens":740,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":467,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":740,"cache_read_input_tokens":877730,"cache_creation_input_tokens":467,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":467},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"afe97882-36b3-4a88-aa42-f290f63c6981","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgpzSQ3wNJWHVREfCNGo7","requestRef":"58dc1929-55b2-4acd-8db0-ff05e0512730","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"cfdfdc38-6d7a-403f-ba76-7b99745a1b90","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:31:09.755Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
